 513:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
 514:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Reads characters from SEGGER real-time-terminal control block
 515:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    which have been previously stored by the host.
 516:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Do not lock against interrupts and multiple access.
 517:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 518:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
 519:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of Down-buffer to be used (e.g. 0 for "Terminal").
 520:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to buffer provided by target application, to copy characters from RTT-dow
 521:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferSize   Size of the target application buffer.
 522:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 523:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
 524:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes that have been read.
 525:Core/SystemView/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
